  "duration_seconds": 100.73,
  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.56,
    "text": "This is an extreme hidden competition show with a $100,000 prize, where six elite experts"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 5.56,
    "end": 9.68,
    "text": "must hide inside an abandoned courthouse, and if they avoid being found for one hour,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 9.68,
    "end": 10.68,
    "text": "they win."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 10.68,
    "end": 13.6,
    "text": "At first, they get three days to study the building and build their hiding spots."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 13.6,
    "end": 18.12,
    "text": "The first player, Alex, chooses a cabinet, and it sounds obvious, but the cabinet actually"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 18.12,
    "end": 19.24,
    "text": "has two levels."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 19.24,
    "end": 23.76,
    "text": "He reconstructs the whole thing, lowering the upper compartment by 1.6 feet and creates"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 23.76,
    "end": 25.28,
    "text": "a hidden door at the bottom."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 25.28,
    "end": 27.52,
    "text": "Even if the hunter opens it, he'll see nothing wrong."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 27.52,
    "end": 29.56,
    "text": "Sam refuses to hide inside the main building."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 29.56,
    "end": 33.36,
    "text": "He targets the entrance gate because between the walls there's a narrow space that perfectly"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 33.36,
    "end": 36.8,
    "text": "follows the rules, and it's the last place the Hunter would ever check."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 36.8,
    "end": 38.08,
    "text": "Tony decides to go underground."
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 38.08,
    "end": 39.88,
    "text": "He installs a custom-made marble step."
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 39.88,
    "end": 43.92,
    "text": "In previous seasons, the Hunter knocked on floors to detect hollow spaces, so Tony used"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 43.92,
    "end": 47.36,
    "text": "thick marble that absorbs sound and made the perfect silent bunker."
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 47.36,
    "end": 51.08,
    "text": "Max is the craziest because he notices the production team always sets up a control"
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 51.08,
    "end": 54.56,
    "text": "room where hiding is forbidden, and the Hunter never looks there, so he spends two and a"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 54.56,
    "end": 57.96,
    "text": "half days building an entire fake studio design, even with the fake staff."
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 57.96,
    "end": 62.12,
    "text": "Jack discovers a secret office door during scouting, but it's not safe enough, so he"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 62.12,
    "end": 66.24,
    "text": "hires a renovation team, transforms the whole wall, adds golden frames, and camouflages the"
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 66.24,
    "end": 68.68,
    "text": "door so perfectly, you'd swear it was always there."
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 68.68,
    "end": 72.2,
    "text": "Chris uses the courtroom furniture, he rebuilds a door with a small hole at the bottom, then"
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 72.2,
    "end": 74.52,
    "text": "brings a full row of folding chairs to block the opening."
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 74.52,
    "end": 76.92,
    "text": "When the chairs fold, the hole becomes completely invisible."
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 76.92,
    "end": 80.12,
    "text": "These hiding spots are insane, but will the hunter find the hiding experts?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t27",
    "start": 80.12,
    "end": 81.12,
    "text": "The countdown starts."
   },
   {
    "id": "t28",
    "start": 81.12,
    "end": 84.4,
    "text": "The hunter enters through the courthouse doors and he doesn't even consider the entrance,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t29",
    "start": 84.4,
    "end": 85.72,
    "text": "meaning Sam is safe."
   },
   {
    "id": "t30",
    "start": 85.72,
    "end": 88.0,
    "text": "He taps statues and walls to detect hollows."
   },
   {
    "id": "t31",
    "start": 88.0,
    "end": 90.0,
    "text": "Tony's thick marble floor gives him nothing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t32",
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 91.6,
    "text": "Then he reaches Max's fake studio."
   },
   {
    "id": "t33",
    "start": 91.6,
    "end": 93.32,
    "text": "At first, he only planned to greet the staff,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t34",
    "start": 93.32,
    "end": 94.88,
    "text": "but then he notices something strange."
   },
   {
    "id": "t35",
    "start": 94.88,
    "end": 96.88,
    "text": "He doesn't recognize any of the cameramen."
   }
  ]
 },
